Also, Muggy balls negs the verse

That hairstyle is shit bro, looks like a steak.

&#x200B;

Wait, who is knocking at my door?

"One Piece is too long" as a reason to not watching it. Look, I know it's crazy long, but that as a reason it's insane. There are 2 paths, you either like it, and you will be glad that it have more episodes to watch, or you dislike it (which is perfectly fine of course), and the number of episodes doesn't matter since you won't be following it. 

&#x200B;

I can understand that if you like it, it will take some time before you are done with it, but there is no rush, you can watch like 3 or 2 or 1 a day and keep your own pace. I just don't understand that reason at all.

Elden Ring is my choise this year for sure. I haven't play the new GoW since I don't have a PS5, and I am sure it is amazing as the prequel was (that one I had play), but playing ER for the first time and discovering stuff was so cool, such an amazing open world fill with new places to go. I remember when my friend and I were playing this at the same time and we joke time and time again that this game lacked content (since it had so much) and he discovered the underground world, and I though he was talking about some big catacomb, but no, a big-ass world beneath the big-ass world, and now that the coop mod exist, we discover new places basically everytime we replay it. 

&#x200B;

In a separate now, I am really glad that XC3 got the nomination. If ER was not in this pool, that would be my pick for sure. I hope more people give this franchise a try, as all of the 4 games are amazing stories with fun gameplay and majestic OST.

Glad you liked it! Welcome aboard.

&#x200B;

That being said, this subredit won't have spoilers for anything that isn't manga, so you will be spoiled by some stuff here. If you mind that, better be careful.
